{
  "id": "bars",
  "name": "Barnes Akathisia Rating Scale (BARS)",
  "directions": "Clinician observes the person seated and standing for at least two minutes in each position, then elicits subjective symptoms. Score objective, awareness, and distress items separately (0–9 total); record the global clinical assessment separately.",
